{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":10},"La Ferme à Gégé","Gérard Coutances dit « gégé », vit depuis 3 générations en fermage dans le bocage normand. Dans les années 90, totalement endetté, il transforme son exploitation en un lieu d’accueil pour enfants. La ferme à Gégé devient un lieu unique d’accueil en France. Aujourd’hui, en l’absence de successeur et menacée d’expulsion, la ferme à Gégé risque de disparaitre et avec elle un regard si particulier sur la pédagogie et la culture populaire.",[4,5,6,7,8,9],"legacy","rural","self-employment","independent home","precarity","disappearing professions",{"type":11,"id":12,"slug":13,"title":14,"release":16,"filmType":20,"directors":21,"genre":30,"media":33,"synopsis":36,"production":37,"characters":40,"roles":41,"awards":46,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_039","fr2023-039-la-ferme-a-gege",{"native":1,"english":15},"",{"type":17,"date":18,"year":19},"Theatrical release","2023-02-08",2023,"Documentary",[22],{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":29},"Florent Verdet","florent-verdet",1973,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[31,32],"Documentary – Observational mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":34,"trailerUrl":35},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/45/248/260141/format_page/la-ferme-a-gege.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U6tQTIZGrwo",{"native":2,"english":15},[38],{"country":28,"share":39},"Majority coproducer",[],[42],{"person":43,"role":45},{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":44},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
